# Dynamic Tab Indicator — a paging photo carousel (France, Italy, Iceland, Norway, Japan) under a tab row whose underline interpolates its x/width from the scroll offset to the measured title layouts.
# What this test covers: jumping to the last and first tabs (indicator crosses every title), stepping through each
# tab, tapping a new tab while the previous programmatic scroll is still animating, paging by swipe in both
# directions, overscrolling past both ends (clamped interpolation), a short drag that snaps back to the same page,
# and a fast tab burst.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/dynamic-tab-indicator"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait "text" "Iceland" 10000
wait 800
press "text=\"Japan\""
wait 1000
press "text=\"France\""
wait 1000
press "text=\"Italy\""
wait 700
press "text=\"Iceland\""
wait 700
press "text=\"Norway\""
wait 700
# Interrupt: retarget while the previous scrollTo is mid-flight.
press "text=\"France\""
wait 120
press "text=\"Japan\""
wait 120
press "text=\"Italy\""
wait 1000
# Page by swiping the photos.
swipe 330 500 60 500
wait 900
swipe 330 500 60 500
wait 900
swipe 330 500 60 500
wait 900
# Overscroll past the last page.
swipe 330 500 40 500
wait 900
# Short drag that should snap back to the same page.
gesture pan 200 500 -60 0 500
wait 900
# Page back to the first and overscroll past it.
swipe 60 500 330 500
wait 700
swipe 60 500 330 500
wait 700
swipe 60 500 330 500
wait 700
swipe 60 500 330 500
wait 700
swipe 40 500 360 500
wait 900
# Fast tab burst.
press "text=\"Norway\""
press "text=\"Iceland\""
press "text=\"Japan\""
press "text=\"France\""
wait 1200
wait "text" "France" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
